  "details": "<p>The Tagisken plateau contains two burial sites: A larger southern site dated to the early Saka period (7th-5th centuries BCE) and a smaller northern site used throughout the first half of the first millennium BCE (Itina &amp; IAblonski\u012d 2001).</p>",
